<view class="page-hospital">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">医院服务</view>
      <view
        wx:for="{{entries}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="hsp-item"
        data-url="{{item.url}}"
        bindtap="onOpen"
      >
        <view class="hsp-row">
          <view>
            <view class="hsp-item-title">{{item.label}}</view>
            <view class="text-muted hsp-item-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
          </view>
          <text class="hsp-arrow">›</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="text-muted hsp-note">
      医院导航与院区选择在首版不提供：多院区属二期待办，且本系统不对接真实地图
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
